% [author-bibtex] THE NEAREST NEIGHBOUR IN METHOD SPACE, and the comparison the
% proposal did not name: canonical Gaussian *surfels*, per-frame initialisation
% from the previous frame, adaptive densification, and an explicit temporal
% consistency term on curvature maps to suppress jitter - i.e. the same three
% mechanisms as CV-Dyn2DGS, but with geometry learned instead of pinned to a
% variational surface. Reports 38 s/frame training, so its cost is directly
% comparable to the precompute of sec. 7.5. Code: github.com/fraunhoferhhi/AT-GS
